  "input": "Costco's fiscal 2025 had how many weeks, and why does that matter when comparing net sales growth to fiscal 2024?",
  "final_output": "Costco's fiscal 2025 had 52 weeks, while fiscal 2024 also had 52 weeks. This matters because fiscal 2023 had 53 weeks, so when comparing year-over-year performance, the different number of weeks can impact the comparability of net sales figures. Costco operates on a 52/53-week fiscal year basis with the year ending on the Sunday closest to August 31.",
